      "caption": "Lately, I’ve been realizing just how much has changed in my life all at once. I’m working through my weight loss journey, learning how to live farther away from my family, adjusting to being fully WFH, trying to keep up with my career as a content creator, figuring out life in a new state, and somehow going back to school too 😂 And if I’m being honest, somewhere in the middle of all of that, I started to feel a little disconnected from myself. I think I’ve been so focused on making everything work that I forgot to actually enjoy it. I moved. I’m building the life I prayed for. I’m becoming the person I’ve been working so hard to become… but I don’t want to look up one day and realize I missed the fun part. So lately, I’ve been giving myself permission to get cute, go out, make memories, and just be present. I’m still figuring this season out, but I’m proud of myself for continuing to show up, even on the days when I don’t feel like myself🤍",
